              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Gabi Dotson"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I altered the recipe and added green bell pepper a tablespoon of dried dill weed and some seasoning salt. As the other reviewers stated the salad is a bit dry but I like a drier mac salad versus a creamy one. Tasted and looked great!",
            "datePublished": "2016-07-17T21:14:02.367Z"
