              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Sweetie"
            },
            "reviewBody": "My mother-n-law is full German and just moved back to the us from Germany. This is just like her recipe. But she DOES NOT add raw egg. I think that was a misunderstading in your recipe.\n\nWhen I make it, I add Cilantro and use miracle whip. And when I want to switch it up I use turkey. It's very good!",
            "datePublished": "2008-08-15T11:45:13.410Z"
          },
          {
