            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "BrewCrew"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I wonder if the 5 cups of macaroni is a typo, I believe it should read \"5 cups cooked macaroni.\" That is the assumption I used when making this recipe, but still I ended up adding more mayo and some milk on the advice of another reviewer. Also, I used some dill relish in place of the pickle (same thing, right?).",
